def dealnnoy_num(n, k):
    def binomial_coefficient(n, k):
        numerator = 1
        denominator = 1
        for i in range(1, k + 1):
            numerator *= (n - i + 1)
            denominator *= i
        return numerator // denominator

    # Implementation of delannoy number formula
    return binomial_coefficient(n + 1, k + n) // (binomial_coefficient(k + 1, k) * binomial_coefficient(n, k))
```

